      "body": "## Summary\n- Add a TurboQuant KV cache section to the quantized KV cache documentation.\n- List the user-facing `kv_cache_dtype` TurboQuant presets.\n- Clarify that TurboQuant compatibility depends on the model architecture, attention backend, head dimension, and cache layout, and that FP8/auto are the portable fallback.\n\n## Why this is not duplicating an existing PR\n- Checked open PRs with:\n  - `gh pr list --repo vllm-project/vllm --state open --search 'TurboQuant Gemma4 KV cache docs'`\n  - `gh pr list --repo vllm-project/vllm --state open --search 'turboquant kv-cache dtype docs'`\n- Found several TurboQuant implementation PRs, but no open PR specifically documenting the public `kv_cache_dtype` presets in the quantized KV cache guide.\n\n## Test Plan\n- `git diff --check`\n- `.venv/bin/pre-commit run --files docs/features/quantization/quantized_kvcache.md`\n\n## Notes\n- AI assistance was used to draft this documentation change. The changed lines were reviewed before submission.\n",
